 class="absolute bottom-0 left-[46px] h-[22px]" style="right:16px" aria-hidden="true"> <span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:8.695652173913043%"> Nov 24 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:21.73913043478261%"> Feb 25 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:34.78260869565217%"> May 25 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:47.82608695652174%"> Aug 25 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:60.86956521739131%"> Nov 25 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:73.91304347826086%"> Feb 26 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:86.95652173913044%"> May 26 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:100%"> Aug 26 </span> </div> </div> </div> <p class="mt-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">The 12-month rate of 36% averages each listing's whole year, slow months included; each month here counts only the listings booked in it.</p>  </figure></div> </div>  </div> </section>  <section id="nightly-rates" class="mg-section mg-col"> <div class="mg-title mb-8"> <p class="font-lato text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"> Nightly rates </p> <h2 class="mg-serif mt-1.5 text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.12] sm:text-[36px] tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1e293b]"> How Much Does an Airbnb Cost per Night in Conway? </h2>  </div> <div class="mg-report prose max-w-none">  <div id="monthly-rates"> <p>The average nightly rate in Conway, known as ADR (average daily rate), was <strong>$234</strong> over the past year, about 34% below the South Carolina average of $355 and about 27% below the U.S. average of $320. In a typical year, rates peak in July and August at about $235 and bottom out in October and November at about $195.</p><p>Prices span a wide range: the top 10% charge about 3.4 times the rate of the bottom quarter.</p><ul class="not-prose my-5 space-y-1.5"><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#5f5ab8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Best-in-class properties</span> (top 10%) charge <strong>$375+</strong> a night, about twice the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#8884d8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Strong performers</span> (top 25%) charge <strong>$285</strong> or more, about $100 above the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#b3b0e6"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Typical properties</span> (median) charge about <strong>$185</strong> a night.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#dddcf5"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Entry-level properties</span> (bottom 25%) charge <strong>$110</strong> or less, about 59% of the median.</li></ul><div class="not-prose my-8"><figure class="pseo-figure font-lato rounded-[4px] bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.06),0_3px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.07)] p-5 sm:p-6 [&#38;_.pseo-table]:shadow-none"> <figcaption> <p class="text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]">July rates run 19% above November&#39;s</p> <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">Average nightly rate (ADR), by month, September 2024 to August 2026</p>  </figcaption> <div class="mt-5"><div class="pseo-line relative select-none font-lato" style="height:260px" role="img" aria-label="Average nightly rate in Conway by month, September 2024 to August 2026" data-pseo-chart> <div class="absolute bottom-[30px] left-0 top-[10px] w-[46px]" aria-hidden="true"> <span class="absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] tabular-nums " style="top:100%"> $0 </span><span class="absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] tabular-nums " style="top:66.66666666666667%"> $100 </span><span class="absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] tabular-nums " style="top:33.33333333333334%"> $200 </span><span class="absolute right-2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] tabular-nums " style="top:0%"> $300 </span>  </div> <div class="absolute bottom-[30px] left-[46px] top-[10px]" style="right:16px" data-plot> <span class="absolute inset-x-0 border-t " style="top:100%;border-color:#cbd5e1" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute inset-x-0 border-t " style="top:66.66666666666667%;border-color:#e9eef4" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute inset-x-0 border-t " style="top:33.33333333333334%;border-color:#e9eef4" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute inset-x-0 border-t " style="top:0%;border-color:#e9eef4" aria-hidden="true"></span>  <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full overflow-visible" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M0,400.6666666666664L43.47826086956522,406.40780141843976L86.95652173913044,417.32269503546104L130.43478260869566,349.5175438596492L173.91304347826087,352.89230769230755L217.3913043478261,372.110256410256L260.8695652173913,356.4153846153846L304.34782608695656,349.7897435897434L347.82608695652175,306.22307692307675L391.304347