 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>It depends most on the home's size, location and how it's run. The middle half of Murrells Inlet listings earn between $1,960 and $6,390 in a typical month, and the top tenth $11,600 or more. For one home, enter its address and bedroom count in the <a href="/calculator" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Airbnb income calculator</a>: it compares the home with similar listings nearby.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What is the average Airbnb occupancy rate in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Listings in Murrells Inlet were booked on 42% of available nights over the past year. That compares with 39% for the South Carolina average. June is usually the busiest month.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How much does an Airbnb cost per night in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>The average booked night in Murrells Inlet cost $405 before fees. Half of listings charge between $200 and $445, so bedroom count and location move the price more than the average suggests.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>Do you need a permit for an Airbnb in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>None of the active Murrells Inlet listings display a registration, permit or license number. That doesn't mean no rules apply, so confirm registration, permit and occupancy-tax rules with the city or county before buying.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>Is Airbnb profitable in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Yes, when it's run well. The average Murrells Inlet Airbnb grossed $47,603 in the 12 months to September 2026, 27% above the South Carolina average of $37,525. Run by its owner, with the cleaning fee covering the cleaner and everyday costs for Airbnb's fee, utilities, supplies, upkeep and insurance, $28,623 a year (about $2,390 a month) is left before the mortgage or rent. A home that costs less than that to own or rent makes a profit, and a listing at the top-quarter mark leaves about $4,290 a month. Check a specific home in the <a href="/calculator" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Airbnb estimator</a>.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>When is Airbnb peak season in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>July usually pays best, averaging $9,780 per active listing over the past two years, and January usually pays least. The month-by-month table above shows how the latest 12 months played out.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What is the Airbnb RevPAR in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Each night a Murrells Inlet listing was open to book earned $189 on average over the past year, booked or not. That figure, revenue per available night (RevPAR), folds price and occupancy into one number; the top 10% of listings made $385 or more.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How far in advance do guests book Airbnbs in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Murrells Inlet stays were booked 64 days (about two months) before arrival on average over the past year, so a listing that opens its calendar late misses many bookings.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How long do guests stay at Airbnbs in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>The average Murrells Inlet Airbnb stay lasted 5 nights over the past year. A listing took 23 reservations over the year on average.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How are Airbnbs in Murrells Inlet rated?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Guests rate Murrells Inlet Airbnbs 4.86 out of 5 on average. Guests score location highest and value lowest.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What are the best neighborhoods for Airbnb in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Murrells Inlet Marsh Walk, Brunswick Plantation and The Inlet draw the most short-term rental interest in Murrells Inlet. The <a href="#neighborhoods" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">neighborhood guide</a> explains what brings guests to each.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How many Airbnbs are there in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>AirROI counted 478 active Airbnb listings in Murrells Inlet as of September 2026. The closest tracked market is <a href="/airbnb-data/united-states/south-carolina/garden-city-beach" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Garden City Beach</a>, 3 km away.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How much are Airbnb cleaning fees in Murrells Inlet?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>In Murrells Inlet, nearly all listings add a cleaning fee. The median fee is $225, and some higher fees lift the average to $362.</p> </div> </details> </div> </section><section id="about-data" class="mg-section mg-col"> <div class="mg-title mb-8"> <p class="font-lato text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"> Method </p> <h2 class="mg-serif mt-1.5 text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.12] sm:text-[36px] tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1e293b]"> About This Data </h2>  </div> <div class="mg-report prose max-w-none">  <div class="space-y-4"> <p id="about-data-summary">
