Airbnb Cost per Night in Pawleys Island? </h2>  </div> <div class="mg-report prose max-w-none">  <div id="monthly-rates"> <p>The average nightly rate in Pawleys Island, known as ADR (average daily rate), was <strong>$392</strong> over the past year, about 10% above the South Carolina average of $355 and about 23% above the U.S. average of $320. In a typical year, rates peak in June and July at about $415 and bottom out in October and November at about $300.</p><p>Prices span a wide range: the top 10% charge about 3.7 times the rate of the bottom quarter.</p><ul class="not-prose my-5 space-y-1.5"><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#5f5ab8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Best-in-class properties</span> (top 10%) charge <strong>$720+</strong> a night, about 2.6 times the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#8884d8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Strong performers</span> (top 25%) charge <strong>$435</strong> or more, about $160 above the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#b3b0e6"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Typical properties</span> (median) charge about <strong>$280</strong> a night.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#dddcf5"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Entry-level properties</span> (bottom 25%) charge <strong>$195</strong> or less, about two-thirds of the median.</li></ul><div class="not-prose my-8"><figure class="pseo-figure font-lato rounded-[4px] bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.06),0_3px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.07)] p-5 sm:p-6 [&#38;_.pseo-table]:shadow-none"> <figcaption> <p class="text-[16px] font-bold l