htly rates </p> <h2 class="mg-serif mt-1.5 text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.12] sm:text-[36px] tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1e293b]"> How Much Does an Airbnb Cost per Night in Surfside Beach? </h2>  </div> <div class="mg-report prose max-w-none">  <div id="monthly-rates"> <p>The average nightly rate in Surfside Beach, known as ADR (average daily rate), was <strong>$419</strong> over the past year, about 18% above the South Carolina average of $355 and about 31% above the U.S. average of $320. In a typical year, rates swing with the seasons, from about $320 in November to about $485 in June and July.</p><p>Prices span a wide range: the top 10% charge about 3.8 times the rate of the bottom quarter.</p><ul class="not-prose my-5 space-y-1.5"><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#5f5ab8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Best-in-class properties</span> (top 10%) charge <strong>$800+</strong> a night, about 2.6 times the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#8884d8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Strong performers</span> (top 25%) charge <strong>$530</strong> or more, about $230 above the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#b3b0e6"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Typical properties</span> (median) charge about <strong>$305</strong> a night.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#dddcf5"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Entry-level properties</span> (bottom 25%) charge <strong>$210</strong> or less, about two-thirds of the median.</li></ul><div class="not-prose my-8"><figure class="pseo-figure font-lato rounded-[4px] bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_